id: pm-web-v6p4
title: Diagnose SDK incompatibility before full fleet command discovery
description: "The complete fleet snapshot generator fails during pm-github command registration because the resolved @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk does not export previewItemMutations. The package host pin is 2026.10.19; the current registry CLI is 2026.10.21. The pm-memory and pm-rlm receipts were refreshed successfully through the scoped mode for pm-web-7u2y, preserving all other receipts. Determine the exact resolved SDK/extension version requirement, report incompatibility before activation with a useful bounded diagnostic, and verify complete generation after the separately owned toolchain update. Preserve previous snapshots on failure; scoped generation is not certification of whole-fleet freshness. Related metadata history: pm-web-5hdb. No dependency pin change is part of the current graph/catalog work."
